meta {
  name: ENG - register iTwin B
  type: http
  seq: 22
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/eng/twins
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "iTwinId": "{{twinB}}",
    "code": "PLANT-B",
    "name": "Plant B",
    "description": "Second plant, reusing Plant A's tag numbers on purpose."
  }
}

docs {
  The second plant. Its whole purpose is to reuse a tag number that Plant A
  already has, which before iTwin scoping would have collided on a unique index
  or silently overwritten the first design.
}
